        <item>Easy, Formula One.</item>
        <item>Bro thinks he’s on the grid.</item>
        <item>Alright, we’re getting serious now.</item>
        <item>I see what you’re doing.</item>
        <item>Okay, I see you, racer.</item>
    </string-array>

